%TAG !u! tag:unity3d.com,2011:
--- !u!114 &11400000
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: e9620f8c34305754d8cc9a7e49e852d9, type: 3}
  m_Name: Dialogues_en
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  m_LocaleId:
    m_Code: en
  m_SharedData: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 138a4e0e2d3e70b4ebfbd993cc4371bc, type: 2}
  m_Metadata:
    m_Items: []
  m_TableData:
  - m_Id: 13540277396193280
    m_Localized: Hey Chuchu, <p=2>what's your opinion on Stellaman?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 13540277396193282
    m_Localized: Who?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 13540277396193283
    m_Localized: <sh>HOW DARE YOU?!</sh>
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 13540277396193284
    m_Localized: Wait<p=5>.<p=5>.<p=5>.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 13540277396193285
    m_Localized: You were joking huh?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 13540277396193286
    m_Localized: "You really have to ,<p=2> Cuicui\u2026"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 13540277396193288
    m_Localized: My man!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 13540277396193289
    m_Localized: <sh>YESSS!</sh><p=5> This is the best work of art in the galaxy!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 13540277396193290
    m_Localized: So why is your girlfriend telling me it's just mid?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 13540277396193291
    m_Localized: Well...<p=5> Magenta has <w>very specific</w> tastes in shows.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 13540277396193292
    m_Localized: Oh really?<p=5> I want to know everything! <p=5>I'd be glad to watch
      a show with her!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 13540277396193293
    m_Localized: What do you suggest?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 13540277396193295
    m_Localized: Doki Doki Sparkling Star
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 13540277396193296
    m_Localized: I'm not entirely sure what's this all about but she's always talking
      about it!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 13540277396193297
    m_Localized: I believe it's the story of two girls thinking about complex stuff?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 13540277396193298
    m_Localized: Sounds like trash
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 13540277396193299
    m_Localized: Hey, <p=2>I can hear you two idiots from here!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 13540277396193300
    m_Localized: Doki Doki is a masterpiece of narration of the impossible romance
      between two schoolgirls!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 13540277396193301
    m_Localized: All of this is skillfully conveyed through delicate and poetic illustrations,<p=2>
      which explore complex themes.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 13540277396193302
    m_Localized: It's a yuri classic,<p=2> you bunch of ignoramuses!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 13540277396193303
    m_Localized: ...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 13540277396193304
    m_Localized: Is there any fight in it?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 13540277396193305
    m_Localized: <sh>URGH!...</sh>
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 13540277396193307
    m_Localized: Stone Decay
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 13540277396193314
    m_Localized: <w>Hi Maggy!</w>
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 13540277396193315
    m_Localized: Yo Marshmallow, <p=2>anything in mind for tonight?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 13540277396193317
    m_Localized: How about a restaurant?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 13540277396193318
    m_Localized: Oh?<p=5> Feeling fancy?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 13540277396193319
    m_Localized: I'm just really hungry...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 13540277396193323
    m_Localized: You know how to talk to girls
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 13540277396193324
    m_Localized: That will be all?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 13540277396193330
    m_Localized: "Hmm\u2026"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 13540277396193331
    m_Localized: <w>Yeah...</w>
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 13540277396193337
    m_Localized: Hmpf...<p=5> Jolli-Jelli,<p=2> always jumping around like a vulagr
      space monkey. <p=5>Where do you think you're going?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 13540277396193338
    m_Localized: Jumping is fun!<p=5> I have the feeling I can reach the stars with
      each bounce!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 13540277396193339
    m_Localized: This girl is hopeless...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 13540277396193340
    m_Localized: "Oh don't be so hard on the lass, <p=2>ch\xE9rie."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 13540277396193341
    m_Localized: You should be coming back to earth and pay your debts instead of
      opening your mouth.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 13540277404581888
    m_Localized: Y<p=1>-yes Merry dear...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 13540277404581890
    m_Localized: "Hello Mr D\xF4!"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 13540277404581891
    m_Localized: <sh>MISTER DOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOO!!!</sh>
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 13540277404581894
    m_Localized: <sh>CHUCHUUUUUUUUUUUUUUUUUUUU!</sh>
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 13540277404581895
    m_Localized: <w>Howdy!</w>
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 13540277404581896
    m_Localized: You gotta help me break da law!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 13540277404581897
    m_Localized: Wait what?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 13540277404581901
    m_Localized: Grmbl...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 13540277404581907
    m_Localized: Leave her alone
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 13540277404581909
    m_Localized: Bother her
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 13540277404581910
    m_Localized: What are you doing Yanya?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 13540277404581911
    m_Localized: <sh>!!!</sh>
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 13540277404581912
    m_Localized: Oh uh...<p=5> hi Chuchu...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 13540277404581913
    m_Localized: I was...<p=5> I was just thinking
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 13540277404581914
    m_Localized: You looked really focused!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 13540277396193308
    m_Localized: It's a crime series where people get turned into stone!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 13540277396193309
    m_Localized: "The heroine is a harpy who has to investigate this case, and she
      meets a vampire and... <p=5>um\u2026"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 13540277396193310
    m_Localized: So what?...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 13540277396193311
    m_Localized: We'll talk about this again in a few years...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 13540277396193312
    m_Localized: Your girlfriend is weird
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 13540277396193320
    m_Localized: That would have surprised me...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 13540277396193322
    m_Localized: Let's go watch a bad movie!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 13540277396193326
    m_Localized: A good sleep!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 13540277396193327
    m_Localized: I have to admit, I'd really like that. <p=5>I need my favorite pillow
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 13540277396193329
    m_Localized: I'll make you a snack!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 13540277396193332
    m_Localized: "That would be a great night\u2026"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 13540277396193333
    m_Localized: <w>Snack time</w>
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 13540277396193334
    m_Localized: I don't get it
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 13540277396193335
    m_Localized: Don't change, Chuchu. <p=5>Never change
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 13540277404581898
    m_Localized: There's a hero tournament or something like that, and Cuicui is
      participating, but I'm not because they say I'm too small!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 13540277404581899
    m_Localized: I want my own super magic marble that gives me powers, too!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 13540277404581900
    m_Localized: I'd love to help you, PiouPiou, but my thing is eating and beating
      up the bad guys...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 13540277404581902
    m_Localized: You stink!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 13540277404581903
    m_Localized: Strangely enough, <p=2>being judged by that snotty 5-year-old hurts
      more than you'd expect...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 13540277404581905
    m_Localized: She stares into space without moving, <p=2>almost drooling
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 13540277404581915
    m_Localized: It's shadow boxing. <p=5>Well... <p=5>not really. <p=5>I'm practicing
      my game in my head.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 13540277404581916
    m_Localized: Oh are you talking about the one where you pick fruit and there's
      weird music playing?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 13540277404581917
    m_Localized: Yes! <p=5>It helps me relax to think about it during my break.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 13540277404581918
    m_Localized: <sh>Yanya!</sh> <p=5>Get your pale little butt moving instead of
      daydreaming! <p=5>We're opening soon!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 13540277404581919
    m_Localized: Speaking of breaks... <p=5>Mine is already over...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 13540277404581921
    m_Localized: Oh?<p=5> Haven't we met before?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 13540277404581922
    m_Localized: YOU!!! It's all your fault!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 13540277404581923
    m_Localized: What?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 13540277404581924
    m_Localized: I was the star of that game,<p=2> and they tossed me aside like
      an old sock as soon as you showed up!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 13540277404581925
    m_Localized: I'm really sorry about what happened to you...<p=5> How about some
      ice cream?<p=5> It always makes you feel better!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 13540277404581926
    m_Localized: ...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 13540277404581927
    m_Localized: Heh...<p=5> I'm just a placeholder, you know.<p=5> I was meant to
      pass the torch on to you.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 13540277404581928
    m_Localized: You'd better impress them.<p=5> Do it for me.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 13540277404581929
    m_Localized: I'll make you proud!<p=5> So hum,<p=2> what about the ice cream?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 13540277404581930
    m_Localized: You're a lost cause
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  references:
    version: 2
    RefIds: []
